# The Wyrm God (abyssea 184) and Meanwhile, Back on Abyssea (185) at Prishe, the reply kinds: a level 99 Warrior in
# Abyssea - Empyreal Paradox with Beneath a Blood Red Sky completed and both quests accepted at Prog 2 (GMs). Prishe
# offers both progressEvents (203 and 204), which tie and rotate by the last event id: the first talk plays Meanwhile's
# 204 (its container comes first), finished; both back to accepted at Prog 2 (GMs): the second talk plays 203, the third
# 204 again. An Event-rank 203 or 204 would lose to the other's Progress each time.
